{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">1</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">0</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">月</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">9</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">日，</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">在新加坡举办的</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2025年</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">东南亚物流博览会</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">上，</span><strong>京东物流正式宣布在马来西亚、新加坡推出大件送装一体服务。</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">具体而言，此次推出的大件送装服务可覆盖马来西亚、新加坡两国的核心城市，</span><strong>消费者下单预约后，将由京东物流进行送货上门并安装，实现多项服务一次上门。</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">目前，</span><strong>京东物流该服务可在马来西亚吉隆坡</strong><strong>的</strong><strong>核心地区实现次日达</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">，随着供应链物流的进一步完善，</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">这一</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">高时效、高标准服务</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">的覆盖范围</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">将持续拓展。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">据悉</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">，该服务针对</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">东南亚地区</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">家电、家具等大件商品消费痛点</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">，</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">构建了</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">覆盖</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">全流程</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">的物流服务</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">体系：</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">消费者线上下单并预约后，</span><strong>由京东物</strong><strong>流</strong><strong>（JoyLogistic）</strong><strong>提供上门服务，全程覆盖送货、安装、调试等环节</strong><strong>，此外还可提供上门退换货等服务</strong><strong>。</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">这一</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">服务</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">模式有效</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">助力解决海外</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大件物流中</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&ldquo;配送与安装脱节&rdquo;&ldquo;时效不稳定&rdquo; 等行业</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">难题</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">此外，该服务的推出也为企业客户提供了更多服务选择，</span><strong>京东物流借助便捷的全球供应链网络，可为大件商品提供覆盖跨境运输、海外本地入仓、仓内出库、配送安装、逆向退换货等全链路服务，</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">省心高效的服务助力企业实现高质量增长。</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1761889832962.png\" /></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">值得关注的是，</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">此次京东物流在新马推出大件送装服务，更</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">成为中国</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">领先</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">的</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">物流服务标准出海的</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">重要</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">实践。</span><strong>十多年来，</strong><strong>京东物流</strong><strong>已经在国内首创&ldquo;</strong><strong>送装拆收</strong><strong>&rdquo;</strong><strong>一体化</strong><strong>末端服务新模式，</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">无论是电视、洗衣机，还是冰箱、空调，京东物流均可通过专业团队一次上门完成新机的配送、安装和旧机的拆卸、回收服务，高品质服务让消费两端的商家、消费者</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">都</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">能省心、放心。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1761889843350.jpg\" /></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12px;\">△&nbsp;京东物流马来西亚海外仓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&ldquo;送装一体服务的推出，是京东物流</span><strong>推进海外</strong><strong>本土化</strong><strong>发展</strong><strong>的重要一步</strong><strong>。&rdquo;</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">京东物流东南亚相关负责人</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">表示</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">，</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">目前，</span><strong>京东物流已在东南亚</strong><strong>运营9大</strong><strong>海外仓库，覆盖马来西亚、泰国</strong><strong>、新加坡、越南、印尼</strong><strong>等核心市场，</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">仅在</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2025年上半年，京东物流已在马来西亚、越南新开3大自营海外仓，并将开通</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">多</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">条中国至东南亚的国际航线，同时</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">还持续</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">提升京东快递国际业务</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">在当地的</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">服务能力。通过加密仓储网、航空网、快递网的三大网络，京东物流将进一步满足中国、东盟国家</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">的</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">企业和消费者对更高效、更省心物流服务的需求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">据新华社</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">报道，</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">《区域全面经济伙伴关系协定》生效实施</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3年多来，成员间经贸合作持续深化，区域经济保持较快增长。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>在东南亚地区，京东物流本地仓配已实现</strong><strong>最快</strong><strong>&ldquo;当日达&rdquo;&ldquo;次日达&rdquo;，跨境物流最快可在72小时内送达。</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">与此同时，</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">随着越来越多东南亚国家的年轻人投身电商行业，</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">以京东物流为代表的</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">不少</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中国</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">企业为东南亚本土人才培养献策出力，为行业可持续发展注入强劲动能。</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mkt.getwuce.jdl.com/mF/commonLandingPage/CTA/c1bfb8a568a849c39f69d57aae0fa3d7?pushId=BmfX2esVQJ3ESdHY7Whevd1\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1761889880592.png\" /></span></span></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content02975", "contentTitle": "中国物流服务出海！京东物流在新马两国推出大件送装一体服务", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1761889951000, "id": 6768, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1761889892345.png", "updateTime": 1761889967000}}